  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d822886221c0364b9fc056e41f01c23, type: 3}
  m_Name: 1_BunkerEnter
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Tutorial
  ID: 0
  Message:
  - Bunker is a safe space where you can craft resources, machines, tools, research
    new technology and Construct the rocket to escape this planet.
  - You can move the camera vertically by dragging your finger up and down, you can
    also zoom in and out by pinching.
  - You can construct different types of rooms by pressing the + button on the top
    right corner of the screen. Start by constructing a Mechanic room.
